ecosystem of partners,

00:37:04.310 --> 00:37:06.140
and our partners
cover everything

00:37:06.140 --> 00:37:08.840
from the production side
to content management,

00:37:08.840 --> 00:37:12.630
content distribution, as well
as the consumer goods, services,

00:37:12.630 --> 00:37:16.448
and management of the
resources themselves.

00:37:16.448 --> 00:37:17.990
As you can see here,
we have partners

00:37:17.990 --> 00:37:21.140
from all over the place, and
this list is ever-growing.

00:37:21.140 --> 00:37:24.170
But all of these become very
important factors when you're

00:37:24.170 --> 00:37:26.000
looking at a virtual
studio deployment

00:37:26.000 --> 00:37:27.710
or a virtual
post-production suite,

00:37:27.710 --> 00:37:30.650
because many of these
folks have already deployed

00:37:30.650 --> 00:37:32.317
cloud native versions
of their software,

00:37:32.317 --> 00:37:34.150
or they're working on
cloud native versions,

00:37:34.150 --> 00:37:35.900
or their existing
versions can actually

00:37:35.900 --> 00:37:37.760
work on cloud-based VM.

00:37:37.760 --> 00:37:39.860
So it's important
to note that we have

00:37:39.860 --> 00:37:41.510
this very extensive network.

00:37:41.510 --> 00:37:43.980
So with that, I'd like to thank
